# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Awaab marketing site — .gitignore
#
# This repo is a hand-written static site (HTML + CSS + a couple of
# PNGs) served by GitHub Pages. There is no build step. Most of the
# entries below are defensive — they keep the repo clean even when a
# tool (Lighthouse, npx, an IDE) drops a stray file into the folder.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ─────── Operating-system noise ───────
# macOS Finder metadata, resource forks, Spotlight indexes, custom icons.
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.TemporaryItems
.VolumeIcon.icns
.com.apple.timemachine.donotpresent
Icon$'\r'

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# Linux
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*


# ─────── Editor & IDE ───────
# JetBrains
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws

# VS Code (workspace settings are per-user for this project)
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

# Sublime / Vim / Emacs / nano
*.sublime-workspace
*.sublime-project
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
.netrwhist
.#*
\#*\#
*.bak
*.backup
*.orig
*.rej

# Other editors
.history/
.ionide/


# ─────── AI tools / assistants ───────
# Claude Code keeps per-user worktrees + session state here. Not for sharing.
.claude/
# Aider chat history and config (per-user).
.aider*
# Cursor local state.
.cursor/


# ─────── Logs ───────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.npm/
.yarn/
.pnp.*


# ─────── Node / package managers (defensive — no build step today) ───────
node_modules/
jspm_packages/
bower_components/
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
.prettiercache


# ─────── Build outputs (defensive) ───────
dist/
build/
out/
.cache/
.parcel-cache/
.next/
.nuxt/
.vuepress/dist
.docusaurus/


# ─────── Audit / report outputs ───────
# Lighthouse and similar tools often dump JSON/HTML into the repo root
# when run from inside it.
lighthouse-results.html
lighthouse-results.json
lighthouse_results/
lh-*.json
lh-*.html
.lighthouseci/

# Coverage (defensive)
coverage/
*.lcov
.nyc_output/


# ─────── Local scratch ───────
# Anything that lives only on your machine. The trailing slash matters:
# `scratch` would also match a tracked file named `scratch`.
scratch/
tmp/
temp/
.tmp/
local/
*.local
*.local.png
*-screenshot.png


# ─────── Secrets & environment ───────
# This site has no env vars or secrets — but if anyone ever adds them,
# they must not land in git.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
*.jks
secrets.*
